<mxCell id="c1241" value="Not fixed: send back + comment (D06, ADMIN only)" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=7.4;fontColor=#c2410c;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="g_sm1221"><mxGeometry x="294.7" y="148.0" width="190.7" height="14.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c1242" value="Each step writes an ActionEventEntity (who / when / note), listed under History on S15.&lt;br&gt;Until VERIFIED, admins can also reassign the responsible person, change priority (resets the due date) or pick a due date (D14/D15).&lt;br&gt;Inspectors at RESOLVED see &amp;#x27;Only an admin can verify this fix.&amp;#x27; — enforced in the UI and in InspectionRepository.requireAdmin()." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=7.8;fontColor=#334155;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="g_sm1221"><mxGeometry x="24.0" y="172.0" width="732.0" height="35.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="g_note1243" value="" style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2300.0" y="3564.1" width="640.0" height="125.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c1244" value="" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;strokeWidth=1;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12.0;" vertex="1" parent="g_note1243"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="0.0" width="640.0" height="125.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c1245" value="KEY FINDINGS FROM THE CODE" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=10.799999999999999;fontColor=#1e293b;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="g_note1243"><mxGeometry x="7.0" y="4.0" width="626.0" height="14.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c1246" value="• Role checks live in the UI (if (user.isAdmin) …) and in repository guards for users and corrective-action verify/reassign; NavHost routes&lt;br&gt;themselves have no guard — admin screens are reachable only through the Account menu item.&lt;br&gt;• Any role may register new equipment: Scan → unknown code → &amp;#x27;New equipment&amp;#x27; (S10) → &amp;#x27;Save and start inspection&amp;#x27;.&lt;br&gt;• Scan (S09) pops itself on success and Submit pops the checklist (S11), so Back from the next screen skips them.&lt;br&gt;• Partial: Safety Assistant Chat and the Home voice note call a hard-coded http://10.0.2.2:3000 dev server (emulator only; cleartext is blocked&lt;br&gt;in release) and otherwise show locally generated/canned text; RECORD_AUDIO is never requested at runtime.&lt;br&gt;• Not drawn as screens: InspectionListScreen, CapturedInspectionDetailsScreen and ChatScreen aliases (no callers);&lt;br&gt;DatabaseSeed.seedSampleData (never called). See GAPS-AND-UNVERIFIED-FLOWS.md." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=9.2;fontColor=#1e293b;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="g_note1243"><mxGeometry x="7.0" y="20.0" width="626.0" height="101.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
